\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Break Thou the bread of life,
\par O Lord, to me,
\par As Thou didst break the loaves
\par Beside the sea:
\par Beyond the sacred page 
\par I seek Thee, lord;
\par My spirits pants for Thee
\par O  living Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou art the Bread of Life,
\par O Lord to me
\par Thy holy word the truth
\par That saveth me;
\par Give me to eat eat live
\par With three Above;
\par Teach me to love Thy truth,
\par For Thou art love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O send Thy Spirit , Lord
\par Now unto me
\par That He may touch my eyes,
\par And make me see;
\par Show me the truth concealed
\par Withing Thy word
\par And in Thy Book revealed
\par I see the Lord.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
